### Peticiones de ejemplo (extensión REST Client de VS Code)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7070
@adminToken = dev-admin-token

### Salud
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Catálogo con disponibilidad
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/catalog

### Reservar un regalo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gifts/bodies-3-6/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 2
}

### Admin: reservas activas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reservations
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Admin: incluir canceladas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reservations?includeCancelled=true
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Admin: cancelar una reserva (reemplaza el id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Confirmar asistencia
# @name confirm
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attendance-confirmations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sanly Ortiz",
  "attendees": 3
}

### Actualizar la confirmación (usa el id de la respuesta anterior)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attendance-confirmations/{{confirm.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sanly Ortiz",
  "attendees": 4
}

### Admin: confirmaciones y total de asistentes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/attendance-confirmations
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}

### Admin: eliminar una confirmación (reemplaza el id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/attendance-confirmations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Admin-Token: {{adminToken}}
